    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d296">

                <pb facs="0412" n="412" xml:id="pg412"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Seward to Mr.
                            Harvey</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 8.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of
                            State</hi>,<lb/><placeName><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington</hi>,</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1861-08-24"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >August</hi> 24, 1861</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Your despatch No. 8, dated July 30, has
                    been received, and I have the pleasure of informing you that the President
                    entirely approves of your diligent and judicious action concerning the proposed
                    proclamation of the government of Portugal. We look with much confidence for
                    good results from it.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer><signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">James E. Harvey</hi>, Esq., <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c., Lisbon</hi>.</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
